<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a service at Dream Haus Hair Boutique cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Pricing at Dream Haus Hair Boutique varies by stylist tier — Silver Star, Gold Star, Platinum, and Diamond. Blow dries start at $35 with a Silver Star stylist and go up to $65 with Diamond. Women's haircuts (which include a blowout) start at $55. Full balayage starts at $295 and ranges up to $500 depending on the stylist tier. Hand-tied weft installs start at $300 per pack. New blonding and extension clients are required to book a consultation before their first service."}},
    {"@type":"Question","name":"How do I book an appointment at Dream Haus?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Appointments at Dream Haus Hair Boutique are booked by text. Text us at (732) 496-6675 with the service you're interested in and your preferred dates, and we'll get you on the books. You can also DM us on Instagram @dreamhaushairboutique_. If you prefer to call, you can reach us at (848) 217-7681 — but text is the fastest way to get on the books. We do not accept appointment requests by email. New color and extension clients are required to book a consultation first so we can match you to the right stylist tier and quote accurately."}},
    {"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need to pay a deposit when booking?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. A non-refundable deposit is required to secure your appointment. The deposit is applied toward your service total on the day of your visit. For extension services, a larger deposit is required to cover the cost of ordering hair, which is custom-ordered for each guest."}},
    {"@type":"Question","name":"What is your cancellation policy?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We require 48 hours notice to cancel or reschedule an appointment. Cancellations within 48 hours forfeit the deposit. No-shows are charged 100% of the scheduled service."}},
    {"@type":"Question","name":"What kind of hair extensions do you offer?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dream Haus specializes in hand-tied weft extensions and tape-in extensions, primarily using Bellami Hair. Hand-tied wefts are best for clients who want long-term length and volume with seamless blending and minimal damage. Tape-ins are a great entry-level option. All extension services begin with a complimentary consultation to match color, assess your natural hair, and discuss maintenance. Most clients return every 6 to 8 weeks for a move-up."}},
    {"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer bridal services?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Dream Haus offers full bridal hair and makeup services for brides, bridesmaids, and flower girls. Bridal hair services include Hollywood Waves ($500), upstyles ($350), and half-up styles with clip-in extensions ($350). Trials start at $250. Bridal makeup is $300 with lashes included, and bridesmaid makeup is $150."}},
    {"@type":"Question","name":"Where is Dream Haus located and what areas do you serve?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dream Haus Hair Boutique is located at 4070 Asbury Avenue, Tinton Falls, NJ 07753 with free onsite parking. We serve clients across all of New Jersey, including Monmouth County, the Jersey Shore (Asbury Park, Red Bank, Long Branch, Holmdel, Middletown, Manasquan, Spring Lake), and Northern New Jersey. Many clients also travel from New York City — we are approximately 60 minutes from Lower Manhattan and 90 minutes from Brooklyn."}},
    {"@type":"Question","name":"How long has Dream Haus been in business?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dream Haus Hair Boutique opened in January 2023. The salon was founded by master stylist Nicoletta, who has over 18 years of professional hair styling experience. Most of our high-tier stylists (Platinum and Gold Star) bring 5+ years of professional experience to the chair."}},
    {"@type":"Question","name":"Who is the owner of Dream Haus Hair Boutique?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dream Haus Hair Boutique is owned and operated by Nicoletta, a Diamond-tier master stylist with over 18 years of experience specializing in dimensional color and hand-tied weft extensions."}}
  ]
